              <Paragraph><TextRuns><TextRun><Value>This is to inform you that your account in our books of accounts has been credited with Rs. </Value><Style><FontSize>10pt</FontSize></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value>=Format(First(Fields!TotalAmount.Value, "PrintCreditNote"), "#,##0.00")</Value><Style><FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight><FontSize>10pt</FontSize></Style></TextRun><TextRun><Value> as per particulars given below. Kindly pass the necessary entries in your books accordingly.</Value><Style><FontSize>10pt</FontSize></Style></TextRun></TextRuns><Style><LineHeight>12pt</LineHeight></Style></Paragraph>
